.el .ds Aq '
.TH garuda-toolbox-users 1  "garuda-toolbox 6.3.0" 
.SH NAME
garuda\-toolbox\-users \- Add, change and remove accounts
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgaruda\-toolbox users\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR \fIWHEN\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR \fICOLUMNS\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add, change and remove accounts
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the programs\*(Aq own words under an error
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR
Print long text directly instead of through `$PAGER`
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Colour the output: auto, always or never
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<COLUMNS>\fR
Cut long cells to this many columns
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Leave out the spinner and the hints
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-users\-list(1)
List the people\*(Aqs accounts and root. `\-\-all` adds the system ones
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-users\-add(1)
Create an account and set its password, at once
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-users\-edit(1)
Change an account\*(Aqs full name, login shell or groups
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-users\-password(1)
Set an account\*(Aqs password, at once
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-users\-lock(1)
Lock an account\*(Aqs password, so it cannot log in with it
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-users\-unlock(1)
Unlock a locked account\*(Aqs password
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-users\-remove(1)
Remove an account. Its home folder stays unless `\-\-delete\-home`
.SH EXTRA
Example:
  garuda\-toolbox users add ada
.SH "SEE ALSO"
garuda\-toolbox(1)
